wildos-installer (0.1.2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * New installs keep the system on Btrfs inside the encryption, with
    separate subvolumes for home, restore points, logs, caches, Windows
    mode and the reset copy, so the system can go back to a restore
    point.
  * A signed copy of Wild OS is kept on the new system for Reset Wild OS
    and start-up recovery.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:00:00 +0000

